---

---

<!-- About/Keahlian Section -->
<section class="reveal py-16 text-left" id="skills">
  <div class="mb-16">
    <h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-4">
      Keahlian
    </h2>
    <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-primary rounded-full"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8">
    <!-- Card 1: Hardware & System Support -->
    <div class="glass-card p-8 rounded-3xl space-y-4">
      <div
        class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-primary"
      >
        <span
          class="material-symbols-outlined"
          style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">hardware</span
        >
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-on-surface">
        Hardware & System Support
      </h3>
      <div class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-md text-body-md space-y-4">
        <p>
          Instalasi, konfigurasi, dan troubleshooting PC/Laptop berbasis Windows
          untuk mendukung kegiatan operasional sekolah. Berpengalaman melakukan
          maintenance perangkat serta memastikan sistem berjalan stabil dan siap
          digunakan.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-1 pl-1">
          <li>• Troubleshooting Hardware & Software</li>
          <li>• Instalasi Windows & Aplikasi</li>
          <li>• Maintenance PC/Laptop</li>
          <li>• Support Microsoft Office & Google Workspace</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 2: Networking & Infrastructure -->
    <div class="glass-card p-8 rounded-3xl space-y-4">
      <div
        class="w-12 h-12 bg-secondary/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-secondary"
      >
        <span
          class="material-symbols-outlined"
          style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">lan</span
        >
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-on-surface">
        Networking & Infrastructure
      </h3>
      <div class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-md text-body-md space-y-4">
        <p>
          Memahami dasar jaringan komputer serta terbiasa menangani konfigurasi
          dan troubleshooting jaringan LAN & Wi-Fi di lingkungan sekolah. Mampu
          melakukan monitoring koneksi internet dan maintenance perangkat
          jaringan.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-1 pl-1">
          <li>• Konfigurasi LAN/WLAN</li>
          <li>• IP Address & Network Sharing</li>
          <li>• Router & Access Point Setup</li>
          <li>• Crimping Kabel UTP & RJ45</li>
          <li>• Troubleshooting Jaringan</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 3: IT Support & User Assistance -->
    <div class="glass-card p-8 rounded-3xl space-y-4">
      <div
        class="w-12 h-12 bg-tertiary/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-tertiary"
      >
        <span
          class="material-symbols-outlined"
          style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">settings_suggest</span
        >
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-on-surface">
        IT Support & User Assistance
      </h3>
      <div class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-md text-body-md space-y-4">
        <p>
          Memberikan dukungan teknis secara responsif dan komunikatif. Mampu
          menangani remote troubleshooting, pengelolaan perangkat IT, serta
          membantu operasional teknologi sehari-hari.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-1 pl-1">
          <li>• Technical Support End-User</li>
          <li>• Remote Support (AnyDesk/Remote Desktop)</li>
          <li>• Asset & Device Management</li>
          <li>• User Assistance & Troubleshooting</li>
          <li>• Problem Solving & Team Collaboration</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
